            "description": "After <$ba.chant>Chanting</> for <@ba.vdown>{chant_duration}</>s, consumes <@ba.vdown>{skill_cost_min_sp}</> <$ba.magicpoint>Mana</> to create an explosion in front of the unit at max range; explosion deals <@ba.vup>{atk_scale:0%}</> ATK as Arts damage to surrounding enemies and causes high ground tiles to collapse, <$ba.stun>Stunning</> them for <@ba.vup>{stun}</>s\n<$ba.chant>Chanting</> can be extended for <@ba.vdown>{extra_chant_duration}</>s; upon completion, consumes <@ba.vdown>all remaining</> <$ba.magicpoint>Mana</>; for every <@ba.vdown>{sp_cost_extra}</> additional <$ba.magicpoint>Mana</> consumed, create 1 additional explosion\n<@ba.rem>Extended chanting can be manually deactivated</>",
